        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.091,
                0.895,
                0.166
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Given the current quality issues with administrative data, the mission advised continuing to use listings data as the primary source for official HPI compilation while applying rigorous data quality checks to maintain consistency and reliability. Concurrently, the SSSU should collaborate with the State Registry and other relevant agencies to enhance the quality, completeness, and matching processes of administrative data, aiming for eventual integration into the official HPI framework.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.178,
                0.899,
                0.253
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Finally, the mission emphasized the importance of publishing retrospective experimental HPI data for 2024 and 2025 to provide users with a longer time series for analysis. This approach balances the need for timely market information with the integrity of the official statistics. Together, these recommendations will support Ukraine's efforts to build a transparent and robust real estate price monitoring system, contributing to informed policy-making and economic recovery.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
